        "name": "Extract Status flag",
        "func": "// Extract only the 'data' part of the payload\n// Convert to bit string\nlet value = msg.payload.data;\n\n// Mask upper 16 bits since they are not used\nlet lower16 = value & 0xFFFF\n\nlet binaryStr = lower16.toString(2).padStart(16, '0');\n\nmsg.payload = binaryStr;\nreturn msg;",
